    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d521">

                <pb facs="0749" n="737" sameAs="frus:frus1945v06/pg737"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 FEAC/10–645: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Australia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Minter</hi>)<anchor n="20" xml:id="d521-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-10-06">October 6,
                        1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>106. Please convey the following message to the Government to which you are
                    accredited: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“The Governments of the United States, the United Kingdom, the Union of
                            Soviet Socialist Republics and China have agreed to the establishment of
                            a Far Eastern Advisory Commission for the consideration of political
                            matters connected with the fulfillment by Japan of its obligations under
                            the instrument of surrender. It is the desire of these Governments that
                            the Commission include representatives of <pb facs="0750" n="738"
                                xml:id="pg738"/> certain other states which have actively
                            participated in the war against Japan and which are principally
                            interested in the area of the western Pacific.</p>
                        <p>A cordial invitation is extended to the Government of Australia to
                            participate in the Commission.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>Please inform Department regarding general reaction to this invitation and
                    whether acceptance probable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d521-f1" n="20" type="source" xml:id="d521-f1-content">
                <p>The same, <hi rendition="#italic">mutatis mutandis</hi>, was sent to Missions in
                    Canada as 89, France as 4656, the Netherlands as 63, and New Zealand as 377;
                    also letter to the Philippines, October 8. Acceptances were received from,
                    Australia, France, the Philippines, and Canada (October 11), and New Zealand and
                    the Netherlands (October 18).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
